664" end="01:12.080">my </span><span begin="01:12.080" end="01:12.616">urges </span><span begin="01:12.616" end="01:13.448">shameshameshame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.448" end="01:15.920"><span begin="01:13.448" end="01:13.680">I </span><span begin="01:13.680" end="01:13.888">need </span><span begin="01:13.888" end="01:14.096">an </span><span begin="01:14.096" end="01:14.360">alibi </span><span begin="01:14.360" end="01:14.608">to </span><span begin="01:14.608" end="01:14.840">justify </span><span begin="01:14.840" end="01:15.088">and </span><span begin="01:15.088" end="01:15.400">somebody </span><span begin="01:15.400" end="01:15.624">to </span><span begin="01:15.624" end="01:15.920">blame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.176" end="01:17.440"><span begin="01:16.176" end="01:16.401">It's </span><span begin="01:16.401" end="01:16.632">a </span><span begin="01:16.632" end="01:16.864">halibut </span><span begin="01:16.864" end="01:17.224">'party </span><span begin="01:17.224" end="01:17.440">bitch'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.624" end="01:19.656"><span begin="01:17.624" end="01:17.896">Give </span><span begin="01:17.896" end="01:18.128">it </span><span begin="01:18.128" end="01:18.344">a </span><span begin="01:18.344" end="01:18.576">name </span><span begin="01:18.576" end="01:19.048">and </span><span begin="01:19.048" end="01:19.656">say</span></p></div></body></tt>